      <td>[[input:ans3]] [[validation:ans3]] [[feedback:prt3]]</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><b>4.</b> A team of \({@n4@}\) players needs a batting order, and the captain must bat last.</td>
      <td>[[input:ans4]] [[validation:ans4]] [[feedback:prt4]]</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><b>5.</b> A number plate has \({@L5@}\) different letters followed by \({@D5@}\) different digits.</td>
      <td>[[input:ans5]] [[validation:ans5]] [[feedback:prt5]]</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><b>6.</b> A playlist of \({@r6@}\) songs is made from \({@n6@}\) songs, and the order matters.</td>
